<title>USA: Amgen Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Amgen Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>THOUSAND OAKS, Calif. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per-share data)</p>
<p>				   Three Months Ended   Year Ended</p>
<p>					  Dec. 31,	   Dec. 31,</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p> Product sales		 $ 559.1  $ 484.2 $2,088.2 $1,818.6</p>
<p>Corporate partner</p>
<p>  revenues			  23.0     20.1    109.9     85.2</p>
<p> Royalty income		   11.4	9.2     41.7     36.1</p>
<p>  Total revenues		 593.5    513.5  2,239.8  1,939.9</p>
