<p>NOTE: Total sales of Neupogen for the quarter increased by 10 percent, to $270 million from $246 million. For the year, total Neupogen sales increased by 9 percent, to $1 billion from $936 million.</p>
<p>Sales of Epogen for the quarter increased by 22 percent, to $289 million from $238 million.  For the year, Epogen sales increased by 21 percent, to $1.1 billion from $883 million.</p>
